        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSM125U32x, Stainless Steel Magnetic Dome Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere are 2 main sections to the magnetic door stop. The 1-3/8\" high dome style base section has a permanent magnet on the face. It is mounted to the floor with the included base, anchors and screws. The magnet is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. The 1\" diameter round holder section is screwed to the door for the magnet catch to hold it in the open position. The Deltana made magnetic door stop is made of stainless steel and is available in Polished or Brushed stainless finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSM125-specifications.gif?v=1704354652\" width\"600\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Magnetic Dome Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-magnetic-dome-door-stop-deltana-dsm125\"><b>Solid Brass Magnetic Dome Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DSM125U32x Stainless Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Base Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Holder Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSM125U32D.pdf?v=1704262240\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  DSM125U32x Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
