                "title": "Stainless Steel Magnetic Dome Door Stop",
                "description": "Stainless Steel Magnetic Dome Door Stop, Deltana DSM125U32x - There are 2 main sections to the magnetic door stop. The 1-3/8 inch high dome style base section has a permanent magnet on the face. It is mounted to the floor with the included base, anchors and screws. The magnet is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. The 1 inch diameter round holder section is screwed to the door for the magnet catch to hold it in the open position. The Deltana made magnetic door stop is made of stainless steel and is available in Polished or Brushed stainless finishes.",
